<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italy CTZ bill auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italy CTZ bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result for the 2.0 trillion lire auction of a ninth tranche of October 31, 1998 two-year Italian Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ).</p>
<p>			   Oct 31, 1998	Previous</p>
<p>Net Yield		  5.34 pct   vs    5.51 pct</p>
<p>Gross Yield		6.14 pct   vs    6.31 pct</p>
<p>Assigned price	  89.55	 vs   89.10</p>
<p>Bids			3.293 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned		  2.000  trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with a previous auction of a seventh tranche of October 31, 1998 Ctzs on December 11.</p>
</text>
